  Even during dinner, Yosuke can't shake the neighboring house from his mind.<K>
<voice name="妻" SRC="14\000107">  "What's wrong, honey? You look like something's bothering you."<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\000203">  "Yeah... I saw the young man from next door today."<K>
<voice name="博美" SRC="14\000308">  "Fuminori?"<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\000403">  "I just had to say something about his yard."<K>
<voice name="妻" SRC="14\000507">  "I know. I wish he'd at least do something about that smell."<K>
  The stink coming from the Sakisaka house grows worse each day, and the Suzumi family is at its wits' end.

<voice name="妻" SRC="14\000607">  "Could there be a dead cat in his bushes? He must notice the smell coming from his own yard."<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\000703">  "Maybe he's leaving his garbage out there."<K>
<voice name="妻" SRC="14\000807">  "He wouldn't..."<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\000903">  "No, I wouldn't put it past him. Who knows what he's doing in there all day with the storm shutters closed. What kind of life is he leading?"

<voice name="博美" SRC="14\001008">  "Did he go crazy?"<K>
<voice name="妻" SRC="14\001107">  "Now, Hiromi, you mustn't say things like that."<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\001203">  "Honestly, with the way things are going, I'm starting to wonder if he's gone paranoid or something."<K>
<voice name="妻" SRC="14\001307">  "Will he be alright?"<K>
<voice name="洋佑" SRC="14\001403">  "Unless he gets help soon, who knows?"

